        {
          "text": "Timurukumanya omu mpaka z'okwiruka kaliitango, abairuki boona nkooku bairuka kwo; baitu anyakutunga ekisembo aba omu? Nahabweki mwiruke, nukwo mukitunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
